      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 300,
      "label": "用户界面层",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 170,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "# 动画引擎\n\nLottie\nSpine 2D\nGPU 加速"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 210,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 170,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "# 交互管理\n\n手势识别\n触摸事件\n拖拽支持"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 170,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "# 状态显示\n\n通知栏图标\n锁屏显示\n悬浮窗"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "**职责：**渲染宠物动画、处理用户交互、显示宠物状态\n\n**技术：**Android View/Canvas、GPU 加速、2D 骨骼动画",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60007",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 400,
      "label": "行为决策层",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 430,
      "width": 270,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "# Layer 1: 行为引擎\n\n**状态：常驻**\n**频率：1-2 Hz**\n\n输入：状态 + 上下文 + 传感器\n模型：10-50M 参数\n输出：行为意图 + 情绪状态"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 310,
      "y": 430,
      "width": 270,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "# Layer 2: 视觉理解\n\n**状态：按需触发**\n**频率：0.02-0.05 Hz**\n\n触发：屏幕变化/定时采样\n模型：1-3B VLA INT4\n输出：视觉语义摘要"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**职责：**理解屏幕内容、做出行为决策、管理情绪状态\n\n**技术：**Transformer/MLP、VLA 模型、LoRA 微调",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60011",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 200,
      "label": "数据采集层",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 930,
      "width": 170,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "# 传感器\n\n加速度计\n陀螺仪\n光线传感器"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 210,
      "y": 930,
      "width": 170,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "# 屏幕截图\n\n每 30-60 秒一次\n图像压缩\n特征提取"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60014",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 930,
      "width": 170,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "# 系统事件\n\n通知监听\nAPP 切换\n充电状态"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60015",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 400,
      "label": "存储层",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60016",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "# SQLite 数据库\n\n**人格参数**\n- 性格倾向\n- 情绪基线\n\n**记忆数据**\n- 短期记忆（最近 10 件事）\n- 长期记忆（重要时刻）"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60017",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**行为历史**\n- 与用户互动记录\n- 情绪变化轨迹\n\n**用户偏好**\n- 宠物位置\n- 交互偏好\n- 通知设置"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60018",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300,
      "label": "On-Device Training",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60019",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 530,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "# 数据收集\n\n- 用户行为序列\n- 屏幕视觉特征\n- 用户反馈信号"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60020",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 530,
      "width": 210,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "# 模型微调\n\n- LoRA 适配器\n- 充电时训练\n- 5-15 分钟"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60021",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**目标：**让宠物随着用户使用而\"成长\"，越来越\"懂\"用户\n\n**隐私：**所有数据本地处理，不出设备",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60022",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 200,
      "label": "硬件抽象层",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60023",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 930,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "# NPU 加速\n\nQualcomm QNN\nMediaTek NeuroPilot"
    },
    {
      "id": "i1b2c3d4e5f60024",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 930,
      "width": 210,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "# GPU 加速\n\n动画渲染\n图像处理"
    }
  ],
